# A slow approach (~2.7 mm/s, below the guard's "moving" speed): the
# backoff direction comes from the contact force estimated from the
# collision residuals (flange wrench), here mostly -x (the wall's normal):
# the arm backs off 20 mm, no force left.
@program arm/arm_sim
@args arm/arcmate/arcmate.arm
@include arm/tests/inc_wall.txt
guard on
lmove 2 930 0 1271 0 0 0
run 2.2
mark
tlmove 15 960 0 1271 0 0 0
run 15
print clear contact guard off
@expect arm.off_reason == 2
@expect arm.guard_dx < -0.8
@expect arm.contact_f == 0
@expect arm.contact_max < 200
@expect arm.clear > 10
@reject ^ERROR
